{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/e475d6a0d2c1427584a6b46c9806fd07.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiosis is a solo or co-op Action RPG that blends base defense, exploration, and survival in a procedurally generated alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of mechanical creatures, scavenge their remains, and loot the environment to craft powerful weapons, armor, and automated defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be shared with friends or braved alone!  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/a45e56debc410750890a279e6822417a.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br>Defend your base, alone or with allies, against swarms of mechanical hybrid creatures. Your only hope of rescue lies in keeping the communication beacon online. But before ships can land on Sigma Century, you must track down and destroy the source of the relentless EMPs disrupting their approach.<br> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/6e1f2e69a38b8b9d47d2b0c46df69dbb.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bases and outposts are vital for survival. Use them to set up defenses, generate electricity, store resources, and support your expeditions across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even the most efficient base can still look great, decorate it and make it your own! <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/e7aa5d1f34106ddda0da044c2c77c2e7.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the hostile environments of planet Sigma Century, gathering resources, crafting tools, and upgrading your equipment to fend off relentless creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drinking and eating are handled efficiently by your advanced suit technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, generating oxygen is another story. You'll need to find, harvest, and process specific elements to keep your life support system running.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/cc9818304a631ce8a5a0883a4531ca6a.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/8eb4e8f658227859aecb50c901c868ad.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/8eb4e8f658227859aecb50c901c868ad.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/8eb4e8f658227859aecb50c901c868ad.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It turns out that the scientists were not just there to collect plant samples. Some creatures appear to have been... modified? They must be eliminated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874540?t=1759175524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/fa4d47629904141a8c4d30975824bbf96d1b3005/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759175524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/89b1ce05af17bb10f103be82a7bd207cd2059b2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759175524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/89b1ce05af17bb10f103be82a7bd207cd2059b2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759175524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/3c73d925a1c19647534f5b382392f785.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=890 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/e475d6a0d2c1427584a6b46c9806fd07.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbiosis is a solo or co-op Action RPG that blends base defense, exploration, and survival in a procedurally generated alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of mechanical creatures, scavenge their remains, and loot the environment to craft powerful weapons, armor, and automated defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be shared with friends or braved alone!  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/a45e56debc410750890a279e6822417a.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ed03d7b9f280ab9518112b5d818fea86.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br>Defend your base, alone or with allies, against swarms of mechanical hybrid creatures. Your only hope of rescue lies in keeping the communication beacon online. But before ships can land on Sigma Century, you must track down and destroy the source of the relentless EMPs disrupting their approach.<br> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/6e1f2e69a38b8b9d47d2b0c46df69dbb.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/ec2e9188b64676f356c67174cf75b69e.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bases and outposts are vital for survival. Use them to set up defenses, generate electricity, store resources, and support your expeditions across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even the most efficient base can still look great, decorate it and make it your own! <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/e7aa5d1f34106ddda0da044c2c77c2e7.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.poster.avif?t=1759175524\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.webm?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/73c569506c131fae22669a0f7de221fc.mp4?t=1759175524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the hostile environments of planet Sigma Century, gathering resources, crafting tools, and upgrading your equipment to fend off relentless creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drinking and eating are handled efficiently by your advanced suit technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, generating oxygen is another story. You'll need to find, harvest, and process specific elements to keep your life support system running.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0